<title>UK: Jarvis in talks for expansion, shr firms up.</title>
<headline>Jarvis in talks for expansion, shr firms up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British facilities and construction group Jarvis Plc confirmed on Friday that it was having &quot;exclusive&quot; discussions to acquire track renewal capacity.</p>
<p>The company's share price rose 7 1/2 pence to 285p after the announcement.</p>
<p>Jarvis did not mention names of any parties with which it is holding talks.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
